  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ol1Tcf8.png\" width=\"143\" height=\"50\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>在寻找<a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/adorn-for-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge/Forge 版本</a>吗？</p><p><strong>Adorn</strong> 是一个装饰和家具模组，添加了许多装饰方块，例如...</p><ul>\n<li>椅子和沙发！你可以坐在上面放松。沙发也是小憩的好地方。</li>\n<li>抽屉！比箱子更小的容器，但作为家具更精致。</li>\n<li>石制火把！它们由石头制成，比木制火把提供更好的光源。</li>\n<li>厨房方块！你可以用厨房台面、橱柜和水槽装饰你的厨房（非常适合厨房水槽整合包！）</li>\n<li>还有更多：桌子、架子、栅栏、烟囱...</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/owM5tUa.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"515\" height=\"289\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Adorn 包含对这些模组的特别支持：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-youll-go-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">BYG</a>（方块变体）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/woods-and-mires\" rel=\"nofollow\">Woods and Mires</a>&nbsp;（方块变体）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terrestria\" rel=\"nofollow\">Terrestria</a>&nbsp;（方块变体）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/traverse\" rel=\"nofollow\">Traverse</a>（方块变体）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cinderscapes\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cinderscapes</a>（方块变体）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biome-makeover\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biome Makeover</a>（方块变体）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/promenade\" rel=\"nofollow\">Promenade</a>（方块变体）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blockus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Blockus</a>（木质方块变体）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/techreborn\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tech Reborn</a>（方块变体）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lil-tater-reloaded\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lil Tater Reloaded</a>（动力土豆）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/towelette\" rel=\"nofollow\">Towelette</a>（可流体化的方块）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu</a>（设置界面）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items\" rel=\"nofollow\">Roughly Enough Items</a>（查看酿造配方）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/emi\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMI</a>（查看酿造配方，开箱即用的配方树默认设置；自 3.6.0 起）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dashloader/\" rel=\"nofollow\">DashLoader</a>（缓存带有 Adorn 方块状态属性的模型）</li>\n</ul><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>请不要在 CurseForge 评论区报告漏洞。Adorn 的漏洞追踪器位于 <a href=\"https://github.com/Juuxel/Adorn/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a>。</strong></p><div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>看看我的其他模组！</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/woods-and-mires\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HeVqFJE.png\" alt=\"Woods and Mires\" width=\"500\"> </a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/painters-blocks\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/uVTHBvB.png\" alt=\"Painter's Blocks\" width=\"500\"> </a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vanilla-parts\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CKffJH2.png\" alt=\"Vanilla Parts\" width=\"500\"> </a></p>\n</div>",
